  "journal": {
    "s19_journal": {
      "title": "The Door That Should Not Open",
      "text": "The gateway woke while we were all in the chamber. The rings turned, and a bright surface filled the ring. Then the bridge fell and stone came down over Elara in the alcove behind it. I crossed on the stepping stones, dug her out and laid timber where the bridge had been. When we reached the landing the ring was full of stars none of us had ever seen. Then it closed, and only a faint blue light stayed in the keystone. Everyone made it out. Nobody can say what we saw."
    }
  }
}